\ Independent month-weaving examples for the canonical endpoint rules.
\ Month lengths 4,4 give twenty legal words, not seventy.
\ Month lengths 4,4,4 give exactly 1301 legal words.
\ Month lengths 4,4,4,4 give 177260 legal words.
\ Each result was enumerated or counted by an independent recurrence.
\ CAL has not yet compiled or executed these checks.

The woven test text is a string.

\ Rebuild a synthetic month-length list without needing a year sauce.
To append synthetic month fixture with a number:
  Allocate memory for a month length record.
  Put the number into the month length record's month length days.
  Append the month length record to the chosen month lengths.

To prepare two synthetic months:
  Destroy the chosen month lengths.
  Put 2 into the selected month count.
  Append synthetic month fixture with 4.
  Append synthetic month fixture with 4.

To prepare three synthetic months:
  Prepare two synthetic months.
  Put 3 into the selected month count.
  Append synthetic month fixture with 4.

To prepare four synthetic months:
  Prepare three synthetic months.
  Put 4 into the selected month count.
  Append synthetic month fixture with 4.

\ The test words use month ORDINALS, not name indices.
To write the selected weaving as test text:
  Put "" into the woven test text.
  Put the chosen woven days' first into an examined woven day record.
  Loop.
    If the examined woven day record is nil, break.
    Convert the examined woven day record's month ordinal to a digit string.
    Append the digit string to the woven test text.
    Put the examined woven day record's next into the examined woven day record.
  Repeat.

To check two-month weaving:
  Prepare two synthetic months.
  Count all possible month weavings.
  If the weaving selection's total completions is not "20",
    put "Four-and-four months should admit 20 eligible weavings." into the check report; exit.
  Put 5 into the weaving selection's target position.
  Put "1" into a weaving rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the weaving rank wide quantity.
  If the weaving selection's selection success is not 1,
    put "The first two-month weaving was rejected." into the check report; exit.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11112222",
    put "The first two-month weaving differs from its reference." into the check report; exit.
  Put "10" into the weaving rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the weaving rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11222112",
    put "The middle two-month weaving differs from its reference." into the check report; exit.
  If the woven requested month ordinal is not 2,
    put "The middle weave selected the wrong target month." into the check report; exit.
  If the woven requested month day is not 3,
    put "The middle weave selected the wrong day within its month." into the check report; exit.
  Put "20" into the weaving rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the weaving rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "12221112",
    put "The final two-month weaving differs from its reference." into the check report; exit.

