To check four-month weaving count:
  Prepare four synthetic months.
  Count all possible month weavings.
  If the weaving selection's total completions is not "177260",
    put "Four months with four days each have the wrong weaving count." into the check report; exit.
  If the weaving selection's resource limit reached is not 0,
    put "The small four-month reference exceeded the memoization guard." into the check report; exit.
  If the weaving selection's memo entry count is greater than 4096,
    put "The small reference exceeded the declared memo entry limit." into the check report; exit.
